@startuml
actor Buyer
participant ShopUI
participant ShopApi
participant CommerceService
database ShopDb
participant AssemblyApi
Buyer -> ShopUI: Выбрать состав
ShopUI -> ShopApi: POST customer/carts
ShopApi -> CommerceService: Create(owner,items,key)
CommerceService -> ShopDb: transaction + advisory lock
CommerceService -> ShopDb: товары + резервы + тип покупателя
CommerceService -> ShopDb: Quote + Cart + Operation
ShopDb --> CommerceService: commit
CommerceService --> ShopApi: DRAFT + Quote
ShopApi --> ShopUI: DRAFT + Quote
Buyer -> ShopUI: Зарезервировать
ShopUI -> ShopApi: reserve(quoteId,key)
ShopApi -> CommerceService: Act
CommerceService -> ShopDb: transaction, проверить цену и остатки
alt все позиции доступны
 CommerceService -> ShopDb: RESERVED + snapshot + Operation
 ShopApi --> ShopUI: RESERVED
else цена/остаток/срок изменились
 ShopApi --> ShopUI: 409
end
opt подбор полного комплекта
 ShopApi -> AssemblyApi: POST compatibility/check(items,products)
 AssemblyApi --> ShopApi: compatible/errors/power
 note right: Чистый endpoint не обращается в магазин
end
opt подтверждение
 ShopUI -> ShopApi: confirm
 ShopApi -> CommerceService: Act(confirm,quoteId,key)
 CommerceService -> ShopDb: transaction: stock -= qty, SaleLine, CONFIRMED
 ShopDb --> CommerceService: commit
 CommerceService --> ShopApi: CONFIRMED
 ShopApi --> ShopUI: CONFIRMED
end
@enduml

